    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to claim your throne in <i>Snake King</i>, a fresh, addictive take on the classic Snake game! In this retro-inspired arcade experience, you'll guide your snake through a simple, open arena, devouring fruit to grow longer with each bite. But the longer you grow, the more challenging it becomes to avoid crashing into the arena walls or your own tail. With increasing speed and length, every move counts!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/356ef128b0c7dde8f09eb94051c81308.poster.avif?t=1737958241\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/356ef128b0c7dde8f09eb94051c81308.webm?t=1737958241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/356ef128b0c7dde8f09eb94051c81308.mp4?t=1737958241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Snake Gameplay</strong>: The goal is simple\u2014eat fruit, grow your snake, and avoid collisions with walls or yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fruits &amp; Growth</strong>: Collect fruit scattered throughout the arena to make your snake longer. The more you eat, the larger\u2014and more difficult\u2014the game becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score and High Score</strong>: Track your current score as you play and try to beat your personal high score with each new game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Snakes</strong>: Unlock and choose different skins and colors for your snake, allowing you to personalize your gameplay experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/52ec99ff1783f613761151faf39b5d19.avif?t=1737958241\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/c62f48d20a0c58ac9a7a27eb2d00f5ee.avif?t=1737958241\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/89ef71b60e2fbd45dcc8ebf1da642b8f.avif?t=1737958241\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/9dd5a17db64c8b681a368bfdd7ab701e.avif?t=1737958241\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Snake King</i>, you control your snake with simple arrow key movements, navigating an open arena as you collect fruit and grow longer. As your snake grows, it becomes harder to avoid your own body, and the increasing speed adds to the difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its nostalgic gameplay, easy-to-learn controls, and challenging progression, <i>Snake King</i> offers endless hours of fun. Can you beat your high score and become the ultimate Snake King?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to claim your throne in <i>Snake King</i>, a fresh, addictive take on the classic Snake game! In this retro-inspired arcade experience, you'll guide your snake through a simple, open arena, devouring fruit to grow longer with each bite. But the longer you grow, the more challenging it becomes to avoid crashing into the arena walls or your own tail. With increasing speed and length, every move counts!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/356ef128b0c7dde8f09eb94051c81308.poster.avif?t=1737958241\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/356ef128b0c7dde8f09eb94051c81308.webm?t=1737958241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/356ef128b0c7dde8f09eb94051c81308.mp4?t=1737958241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Snake Gameplay</strong>: The goal is simple\u2014eat fruit, grow your snake, and avoid collisions with walls or yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fruits &amp; Growth</strong>: Collect fruit scattered throughout the arena to make your snake longer. The more you eat, the larger\u2014and more difficult\u2014the game becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score and High Score</strong>: Track your current score as you play and try to beat your personal high score with each new game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Snakes</strong>: Unlock and choose different skins and colors for your snake, allowing you to personalize your gameplay experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/52ec99ff1783f613761151faf39b5d19.avif?t=1737958241\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/c62f48d20a0c58ac9a7a27eb2d00f5ee.avif?t=1737958241\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/89ef71b60e2fbd45dcc8ebf1da642b8f.avif?t=1737958241\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300910/extras/9dd5a17db64c8b681a368bfdd7ab701e.avif?t=1737958241\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Snake King</i>, you control your snake with simple arrow key movements, navigating an open arena as you collect fruit and grow longer. As your snake grows, it becomes harder to avoid your own body, and the increasing speed adds to the difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its nostalgic gameplay, easy-to-learn controls, and challenging progression, <i>Snake King</i> offers endless hours of fun. Can you beat your high score and become the ultimate Snake King?</p>",
    "short_description": "Snake King is a modern twist on the classic Snake game. Guide your snake through an open arena, eating fruit to grow longer while avoiding walls and your own tail. Simple to play, with increasing speed and difficulty\u2014challenge yourself to beat your high score and become the Snake King!",
